<title>INDIA: CRICKET-AUSTRALIA V INDIA SCOREBOARD.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-AUSTRALIA V INDIA SCOREBOARD.</headline>
<dateline>MOHALI, India 1996-11-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Scoreboard in the Titan Cup</p>
<p>triangular limited-over series preliminary league match between</p>
<p>Australia and India on Sunday:</p>
<p>India</p>
<p> S.Tendulkar c Law b M.Waugh	  62</p>
<p> N.Sidhu run out			  11</p>
