<p>Bowling: McGrath 10-0-52-1 (2nb), Reiffel 10-1-52-0 (1nb,</p>
<p>2w), Gillespie 9-0-63-0 (1nb), M.Waugh 9-0-38-2, Law 10-0-65-2,</p>
